  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.3.1 improves qBittorrent Web API authentication recovery.\n\n\t\t\t- Retried requests once after 401/403 responses by forcing a fresh login.\n\t\t\t- Allowed Web API version negotiation to recover from 403 responses after qBittorrent restarts.\n\t\t\t- Treated empty login responses as successful, matching newer qBittorrent behavior.\n\t\t\t- Added request URL context to network timeout errors.",
